## [Visual Studio - Standard Exclusions]
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# Build outputs and temporary files
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
generated/

# Exceptions for scene debug folders
